<title>SPAIN: Spain's Feb harmonised CPI 2.5 pct vs Jan 2.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Feb harmonised CPI 2.5 pct vs Jan 2.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's harmonised February CPI fell to 2.5 percent versus 2.8 percent in January, the same as the February domestic CPI calculation, the National Statistic Institute INE said on Monday.</p>
<p>Spain's harmonised February CPI fell below the maximum limit laid down by the Maastricht criteria which stood at 2.6 percent in February, INE's statement added.</p>
